msgid ""
"The Holybro S500 is a relatively low cost and easy to assemble frame "
"including autopilot, GPS, motors, BLHeli ESCs and propellers"
msgstr "Holybro S500是一款价格相对低廉、易于组装的机架套件，包含飞控、GPS、电机、BLHeli ESC和螺旋桨"

